{"sha": "c52c20fccda13eb465d89b5519d9e13bcd9a41fedd880571e378c31668d8826b", "body": ["$w_n$：令 $h = \\frac1n \\to 0$，$\\sin h - \\tan h = \\bigl(h -", "\\frac{h^3}{6}\\bigr) - \\bigl(h + \\frac{h^3}{3}\\bigr) + o(h^3) =", "-\\frac{h^3}{2} + o(h^3)$，故 $w_n \\sim -\\dfrac{1}{2n^3}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:taylor:9}", "用 $1$ 阶泰勒–拉格朗日公式在 $x$ 的两侧展开：", "\\[", "f(x + h) = f(x) + h f'(x) + R_+,\\quad", "f(x - h) = f(x) - h f'(x) + R_-,", "\\qquad \\abs{R_\\pm} \\leq \\frac{h^2}{2} \\sup \\abs{f''} .", "\\]", "两式相减：$f(x+h) - f(x-h) = 2h f'(x) + (R_+ - R_-)$，于是", "\\[", "\\abs{f'(x)} \\leq \\frac{\\abs{f(x+h) - f(x-h)}}{2h} +", "\\frac{h}{2}\\sup_{\\intcc{x-h}{x+h}}\\abs{f''} .", "\\]", "由全局界可得：$\\abs{f'(x)} \\leq \\frac{M_0}{h} + \\frac{M_2", "h}{2}$ 对每个 $h > 0$ 成立。右端在 $h =", "\\sqrt{2M_0/M_2}$（导数为零），此时取值为 $\\sqrt{2M_0M_2}$", "--- 因此 $\\abs{f'} \\leq \\sqrt{2M_0M_2}$。（若 $M_2 = 0$，令 $h \\to", "\\infty$：$f' = 0$，与此相符。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:taylor:10}", "在 $\\intoo{0}{\\pi}$ 上：$0 < \\sin u < u$，故 $(u_n)$ 严格", "递减、为正，因而收敛；其极限是一个", "$\\sin$ 在 $\\intcc{0}{\\pi}$ 中的不动点，由 $\\sin \\ell = \\ell$ 推出 $\\ell =", "0$（因 $\\sin x < x$ 对 $x > 0$ 成立）。", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 利用 $\\sin u = u - \\frac{u^3}{6} + o(u^3)$，当 $u \\to 0$ 时：", "        \\[", "        v_{n+1} - v_n = \\frac{1}{\\sin^2 u_n} - \\frac{1}{u_n^2}", "        = \\frac{1}{u_n^2}\\Bigl(\\Bigl(1 - \\frac{u_n^2}{6} +", "        o(u_n^2)\\Bigr)^{\\!-2} - 1\\Bigr)", "        = \\frac{1}{u_n^2}\\Bigl(\\frac{u_n^2}{3} + o(u_n^2)\\Bigr)", "        \\longrightarrow \\frac13 .", "        \\]", "  \\item 由\\cref{exo:b1:seq:10}~(3)（差分形式的切萨罗定理）得，", "        $\\frac{v_n}{n} \\to \\frac13$，即 $v_n \\sim \\frac n3$，亦即", "        $u_n^2 \\sim \\frac 3n$：由 $u_n > 0$，", "        \\[", "        u_n \\sim \\sqrt{\\frac{3}{n}} .", "        \\]", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:taylor:11}", "通分。第一个极限：", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{x^2} - \\frac{1}{\\sin^2 x}", "= \\frac{\\sin^2 x - x^2}{x^2\\sin^2 x},", "\\qquad", "\\sin^2 x = \\Bigl(x - \\frac{x^3}{6} + o(x^4)\\Bigr)^{\\!2}", "= x^2 - \\frac{x^4}{3} + o(x^5) ,", "\\]", "分子为 $-\\frac{x^4}{3} + o(x^4)$，而", "分母 $\\sim x^4$，故极限为 $-\\dfrac13$。", "", "第二个式子：$\\dfrac1x - \\dfrac{1}{\\ln(1+x)} = \\dfrac{\\ln(1+x) -", "x}{x\\ln(1+x)}$；分子为 $-\\frac{x^2}{2} + o(x^2)$，", "分母 $x\\bigl(x + o(x)\\bigr) \\sim x^2$，故极限为", "$-\\dfrac12$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:taylor:12}", "在 $I_k = \\intoo{k\\pi - \\frac\\pi2}{k\\pi + \\frac\\pi2}$ 上，", "函数 $g(x) = \\tan x - x$ 的导数为 $\\tan^2 x \\geq 0$，", "且仅在单点 $k\\pi$ 处为零，故 $g$ 在 $I_k$ 上严格", "递增（由\\cref{cor:b1:derivative:monotone}~(2)），", "两端极限分别为 $-\\infty$ 与 $+\\infty$，故恰有一个", "零点 $x_k$。当 $k \\geq 1$ 时，$g(k\\pi) = -k\\pi < 0$，故 $x_k \\in", "\\intoo{k\\pi}{k\\pi + \\frac\\pi2}$：记 $x_k = k\\pi + \\frac\\pi2 -", "\\varepsilon_k$，其中 $\\varepsilon_k \\in \\intoo{0}{\\frac\\pi2}$。", "于是", "\\[", "x_k = \\tan x_k = \\tan\\Bigl(\\frac\\pi2 - \\varepsilon_k\\Bigr)", "= \\frac{1}{\\tan\\varepsilon_k}", "\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad", "\\varepsilon_k = \\arctan\\frac{1}{x_k} ,", "\\]", "利用 $\\tan\\varepsilon_k = \\frac{1}{x_k}$ 及 $\\varepsilon_k \\in", "\\intoo{0}{\\frac\\pi2}$。由于 $x_k \\geq k\\pi \\to \\infty$，", "$\\varepsilon_k \\to 0$，且", "\\[", "\\varepsilon_k = \\arctan\\frac{1}{x_k} = \\frac{1}{x_k} +", "O\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{x_k^3}\\Bigr)", "= \\frac{1}{k\\pi + O(1)} + O\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{k^3}\\Bigr)", "= \\frac{1}{k\\pi} + O\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{k^2}\\Bigr) ,", "\\]", "由此 $x_k = k\\pi + \\frac\\pi2 - \\frac{1}{k\\pi} +", "o\\bigl(\\frac1k\\bigr)$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:taylor:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $S_{2n+1} - S_{2n-1} = a_{2n} - a_{2n+1} \\geq 0$，且", "$S_{2n+2} - S_{2n} = a_{2n+2} - a_{2n+1} \\leq 0$，而 $S_{2n}", "- S_{2n+1} = a_{2n+1} \\to 0$：数列 $(S_{2n+1})$、", "$(S_{2n})$ 为相邻数列，收敛于公共极限 $S$", "（见\\cref{thm:b1:seq:adjacent}），且 $S_{2n+1} \\leq S \\leq S_{2n}$。", "当 $n$ 为偶数时，$S_{n+1} \\leq S \\leq S_n$ 给出 $-a_{n+1} \\leq S -", "S_n \\leq 0$；当 $n$ 为奇数时，$0 \\leq S - S_n \\leq a_{n+1}$。两种情形下，", "$\\abs{S - S_n} \\leq a_{n+1}$，且 $S - S_n$ 的符号与", "$(-1)^{n+1}$ 相同，即被略去的第一项的符号。严格递减使", "所列各不等式均严格成立，特别地 $0 < \\abs{S -", "S_n} < a_{n+1}$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $a_k = \\frac{1}{k!}$ 严格递减且趋于 $0$：", "第 1 题的结论适用。利用泰勒–拉格朗日公式", "（见\\cref{thm:b1:taylor:lagrange}），对 $\\exp$ 在 $-1$ 与 $0$ 之间：", "$\\abs{\\eu^{-1} - T_n} \\leq \\frac{1}{(n+1)!}$（导数", "$\\eu^t$ 在此处 $\\leq 1$），故 $T_n \\to \\eu^{-1}$，而", "第 1 题的极限 $S$ \\emph{即是} $\\eu^{-1}$，且具有严格界", "$0 < \\abs{\\eu^{-1} - T_n} < \\frac{1}{(n+1)!}$。", ""]}